# Footer

Use `variant="columns"` for spacious grouped navigation, `variant="compact"` for the same structure with tighter spacing, or `variant="minimal"` for a single-row footer. Add `socials` for links with accessible tooltips.

<DocsExample title="Footer variants" source={footerExampleSource} htmlSource={footerExampleHtmlSource} contentless><FooterExample /></DocsExample>

For plain HTML, pass `columns`, `socials`, and `legal-links` as JSON arrays. Set `has-brand-content` and provide `slot="brand"` to replace the default brand text.
